{"part": {"video_part_id": 664, "bvid": "BV1A14y1T7Rh", "page_index": 0, "cid": 920794160, "title": "【作词翻唱】秋叶", "duration_ms": 211000, "processing_status": "metadata_collected", "created_at": 1792025947, "updated_at": 1792025947}, "transcript": {"transcript_id": 1037, "video_part_id": 664, "source_kind": "asr-local", "language": "Chinese", "model_id": 1, "version": 1, "content_sha256": "1f8e87407d620779a38503a9f7e3851033680c0e73e780b9009c7bd455356824", "created_at": 1792058908}, "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start_ms": 400, "end_ms": 1920, "text": "这个也是之前写的一首啊。"}, {"ordinal": 1, "start_ms": 26880, "end_ms": 35760, "text": "玉兰清雨时，风吹散"}, {"ordinal": 2, "start_ms": 37040, "end_ms": 44720, "text": "两枝，落去谁人知？"}, {"ordinal": 3, "start_ms": 47920, "end_ms": 59360, "text": "同是一般痴，在晚风轻拂琉璃湖边，"}, {"ordinal": 4, "start_ms": 62160, "end_ms": 80080, "text": "飘零有几片，更无需思量风的语言，不觉在耳边。"}, {"ordinal": 5, "start_ms": 86880, "end_ms": 93760, "text": "玉兰清雨时，风"}, {"ordinal": 6, "start_ms": 95280, "end_ms": 105680, "text": "吹散两枝，千问谁人知？"}, {"ordinal": 7, "start_ms": 108160, "end_ms": 119440, "text": "秋去春来迟，在名利难免去痴人间，"}, {"ordinal": 8, "start_ms": 122400, "end_ms": 143600, "text": "飘零有几片，倒也叫无情多情人间，不必费遮掩。"}, {"ordinal": 9, "start_ms": 143600, "end_ms": 158080, "text": "玉兰清雨时，风吹散两枝，世情清"}, {"ordinal": 10, "start_ms": 159600, "end_ms": 162000, "text": "冷更胜过秋风，"}, {"ordinal": 11, "start_ms": 164560, "end_ms": 170000, "text": "不留丝雪涟漪，"}, {"ordinal": 12, "start_ms": 171440, "end_ms": 189488, "text": "乍惊欢恨，无语吹寒意。扎进荒痕。"}]}